Angular kya hota hai?

👉 Angular ek frontend framework hai (Google ne banaya hai)

Iska use hota hai:

🌐 Web applications banane ke liye
⚡ Single Page Applications (SPA) ke liye
🔄 Dynamic UI (data change hote hi screen update)
🤔 Angular kyu use karte hain?

Without Angular:

HTML + JS manually manage karna padta hai
Large project messy ho jata hai

With Angular:

Components system milta hai
Code reusable hota hai
Routing easy hoti hai
Data automatically UI me update hota hai

